  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Resourceful_Lib/BH_NU_HEADER.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"284\"></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Resourceful_Lib/BH_NU_BANNER1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"142\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">Resourceful Lib 是一个由 Team Resourceful 开发的模组库，包含有价值的实用程序和 API。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">在撰写本文时，已有多个模组使用了此库，包括 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/resourceful-bees\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Resourceful Bees</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cozy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cozy</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vitalize\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vitalize</a> 等更多模组！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Resourceful_Lib/BH_NU_BANNER2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"144\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 📺 GL 剪裁 API</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 📝 带状态和历史记录的屏幕管理器</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 📠&nbsp; 用于谓词、标签、配方、集合和随机集合的编解码器</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🎨 颜色 API</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🌐 跨平台网络</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 📲 编解码器配方</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 📁 JSON 文件工具</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 💾 内存资源与数据包</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🎲 随机集合/列表</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ⌛&nbsp; 调度 API</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🌎 网络工具</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 📑 YABN（Yet Another Binary Notation）是一种 JSON 的压缩二进制格式，可实现 JSON 对象的小尺寸传输</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 📐 高亮显示 API（不限于方块的定制选择框）<br></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/resourcefulbees\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Resourceful_Lib/BH_NU_BANNER3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"144\"></span></span></a></span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fteamresourceful\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Resourceful_Lib/BH_NU_PROMO.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"362\"></a></p>",
